  "prefLabel": "Puc 101.01 Chairman",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 101.01 “Chairman” means the commission's presiding commissioner and administrative head, who is appointed under RSA 363:4 and possesses the powers and duties conferred under RSA 21-G:9.\n\nSource. #14185, eff 1-24-25",
